  "statement": "Solve $\\log_2 x+\\log_2(x-2)=3$.",
  "solution": "$\\log_2(x(x-2))=3$ so $x(x-2)=8$, i.e. $x^2-2x-8=0$. The roots are $x=4$ and $x=-2$; only $x=4$ is valid since the logarithm requires $x>2$.",
